      "name": "Badger Rage",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "emotion",
        "mental"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The giant badger enters a state of pure rage that lasts for 1 minute, until there are no enemies it can perceive, or until it falls Unconscious, whichever comes first.</p>\n<p>While raging, the giant badger has AC 17, its jaws Strike deals 1d8+8 damage, and its claw Strike deals 1d6+6 damage. While raging, the giant badger also can't use actions that have the concentrate trait except for Seek.</p>\n<p>After it has stopped raging, a giant badger can't use Badger Rage again for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>Effect: Rage</p>",
